  ('Every "Hard" Geometry SAT Question Part 2: Lines, angles, and triangles', 'Walks through hard SAT questions from the Lines, angles, and triangles skill.', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JcsUne7W_D0', 'Mr. McGrinder', 'Video by Mr. McGrinder on YouTube', 'lines_angles_triangles', 12),
